window.products.push({"id":949228,"name":"ANPOPO Under The Sea Cookie Cutter Set - 7 Piece - Seashell, Octopus, Seahorse, Starfish, Crab, Lobster and Heim Metal Cookie Cutters Shapes for Kids ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DudVZmyHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"❤️Sea creatures cookie cutter set❤️ A variety of marine life, children can explore the deep blue ocean world while making cookies at parties or events through these lovely marine-shaped cookie cutters. Set Includes (7 pieces): Tall x Wide x 1\"Deep * Heim: 2.34\" x 2.54\" * Crab: 1.95\" x 3.51\" * Octopus: 2.65\" x 3.32\" * Seahorse: 3.04\" x 1.68\" * Seashell: 2.26\" x 2.73\" * Starfish: 2.93\" x 2.93\" * Lobster: 3.51\" x 2.73\" There are more cute and funny cookie cutter shapes in our store for all kinds of holidays and parties, which can be purchased together. ➤Why choose us? ✔Safety service with Food-Safe Stainless Steel material. ✔Safety use service with smooth cutter edge and binding processed. don’t hurt your hand. ✔0.3 mm Thickness PK 0.2 mm usual thickness, hardly deformed, very durable. ★Tips：Hand wash, and dry immediately ➤Brand story We love life, and we use the metal cookie cutters to dress up the delicate and elegant rituals of different moments in life. We will always remember these wonderful things. ANPOPO is a professional biscuit cutting machine manufacturer with more than ten years of production experience, providing exquisite fondant/biscuit Cutters for customers in many countries. Making baking easy and making life cute and fun is our company's philosophy of developing high-quality cookie cutter with stencil set. ➤Service All of our products are delivered by Amazon, and ANPOPO is the sole brand owner of these cookie cutters. We offer a 100% satisfaction service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us by email and we will provide you with a replacement or free refund. This is the ANPOPO service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DudVZmyHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANPOPO","source_asin":"B07Y7525F2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y7525F2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y7525F2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
