window.products.push({"id":949258,"name":"Wusthof Classic Asian Knife Prep Set 9280","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":225.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31t7JVYpUtL._AC_.jpg","description":"The perfect starter set for hobby cooks. This Asian Cook's Set from Wusthof's Classic Series includes a 3\" Paring Knife (#4000), and a 6.5\" Asian Santoku Knife (#4183).Wusthof Classic Paring Knife Features:The straight edge offers close control for decorating as well as peeling, mincing and dicing.8 cm (3\")Blades are high-carbon stainless steelThe W_STHOF name, TRIDENT-Logo and city of Solingen as place-of-manufacturing proudly etched onto every blade.Wusthof Classic Santuko Knife Features:Styled after the Japanese Cook's Knife this blade is just right for.17 cm (6+\" ) with granton edge.The hollow edge creates pockets of air which prevent extra thin or soft slices from sticking to the blade.The W_STHOF name, TRIDENT-Logo and city of Solingen as place-of-manufacturing proudly etched onto every blade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31t7JVYpUtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00BM8HOLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM8HOLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM8HOLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":949259,"name":"Text Map of The World II Art by Michael Tompsett in Black Frame, 16 by 20-Inch, White Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efu6Ebf6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a text map of the World. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efu6Ebf6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00LGT78AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LGT78AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LGT78AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
