window.products.push({"id":949340,"name":"YRYGYA Aluminum Metal Pizza Peel 12“ x 14” with Foldable Wood Handle - Easy Storage Pizza Spatula for Baking Pizza & Bread in the Oven or BBQ Grill, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71INaFfK4MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to use the Pizza Peel? 1. Turn the wood knob to loosen the screw and turn 180°rotation. Firmly tighten the handle prior to using. 2. Use a generous amount of flour, cornmeal or milled wheat bran to allow the pizza, bread or baked goods to slide easily on or off the peel. 3. Carefully place onto a pizza stone, baking sheet or tray with the peel. 4. Once finished cooking, slide out the pizza, bread or baked goods from the oven with a pizza peel. 5. Hand washes in warm, soapy water. Scrap off any excess food or crumbs from the peel using a soft sponge, then make it dry. Care Instructions: Do not put the pizza dough directly onto the peel without sprinkle flour. Do not soak or use abrasive scrubbers. Not dishwasher safe. Do not leave the pizza peel for a long time in the oven to avoid the wooden handle from burning out. Do not slice the pizza directly on the peel. It may damage your knife blade or leave scratches on the peel. Once you are finished cleaning, loosen the wood knob and turn handle inward for storage. Specification: Color: Aluminum and Wood Size: 12*14 inch Weight: 1.69 pounds Metal Peel: Commercial-Grade Aluminum Handle: All Natural Wood Gift: A roller cutter + a pizza slicer Two in total Measurement: 12-inch x 25-inch (fully extended) 12-inch x 14-inch (folded)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71INaFfK4MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YRYGYA","source_asin":"B091NMFBNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091NMFBNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091NMFBNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
