window.products.push({"id":949361,"name":"Dr. Moxa Adhesive Moxa Rolls Chinese Moxibustion Joss stick on Mild Soft Heat Therapy Beginner Kit ❈ 20 Pcs/box ❈","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SoGbwIcoL._AC_.jpg","description":"* Venting hole at the center of base provides indirect and gentle heat from the moxa on top to your skin. It is much safer and more convenient to use than traditional moxa sticks. No more moxa burners, holders or getting tired from holding moxa sticks. It is so efficient that you can apply on multiple moxibustion / acupuncture points at the same time. * Great for expelling \"damp and chill\" in the body, as says in the Chinese Medicine, to promote blood circulation and relieve pain and fatigue. * Consult your acupuncturist to apply at the relevant acupressure points day-to-day so that you can help yourself in-between acupuncture visits. Dr. Moxa Moxibustion Beginner Kit is for people who want to start Moxibustion to improve their heath condition. This beginner set is simple to use. Just follow the instruction and enjoy the benefit. Moxibustion can effectively improve blood circulation and relieve pain. Moxibustion is used for pain due to arthritis, breast problems, gynecological problems, etc. Attention: Start initial Moxibustion slowly with small amount and shorter duration. Allow the body to adjust before increase dosage. When use Moxibustion on children, elders, or people with diabetes, must always check the temperature of the point of heating. A little hot without causing pain is the most desirable point. Performing Moxibustion, keep indoor WARM and allow fresh air into the room. Burning moxa produces a great deal of smoke and a pungent odor. If the room equipped with good ventilation, this is not a big problem. Maintain comfortable posture without inhaling smoke.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SoGbwIcoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dr. Moxa","source_asin":"B01KETUKZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KETUKZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KETUKZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":949362,"name":"POSTER STOP ONLINE Doctor Who - Glow in The Dark - TV Show Poster (The Doctor, The Tardis & Season 7 Team) (Amy, Rory, River, The Doctor & Clara) (Siz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Oxbx5j4ML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"You will not find this exclusive Dr. Who Glow In The Dark poster anywhere. It features The Doctor (Matt Smith) and his Season 7 Team (Amy, Rory, Clara & River Song). The Windows of the Tardis, the light on top and some of the stars will glow in the dark (after the poster has been \"charged\" with light). Poster and Tesa Poster Stip Set. This set consists of 1 Poster and 4 Tesa Poster strips. These Poster strips are made especially to hang posters on your wall, regardless of the surface structure. The best thing about these Poster strips is that they can be easily removed by simply pulling on them carefully. They will not leave any residue on your wall and, if removed carefully, on your poster either. 1 Strip goes onto each corner of the back of the poster. These poster strips are the perfect alternative to thumb tags because they do not leave any visible marks on the front of your poster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Oxbx5j4ML._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POSTER STOP ONLINE","source_asin":"B00FZSD8D8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FZSD8D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FZSD8D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
