window.products.push({"id":949644,"name":"Nutritionist SY5A Soy Milk Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TJUOZVbUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description THIS IS A BRAND NEW ITEM; it has never been used. The packaging of this product was damaged during shipping to a retail store. It was returned to the manufacturer who sold it with either damaged or missing packaging. Their loss is your gain. You get a brand new item at a fraction of the retail cost. So, you may get torn (or missing) packaging , which you would throw away anyway , but you will get a brand new product complete w/ the manufacture's warranty. Get evenly melted cheese on burgers & perfectly heated toppings on meat! The unique 1 float & lock hinge allows you to grill thicker cuts, plus locks in place for even top,melting and more. The 72 Sq. In. plates fit up to 5 servings and feature our George Tough triple nonstick coating; combined with a patented sloped design, fat and grease easily drain away from food for healthier cooking without a hassle. All this plus an attractive safe,touch top housing and extended metal loop handle for added security and locking side latches for vertical storage. , 72 Sq. In. cooks up to 5 servings , Patented sloped design for healthier cooking , George Tough triple nonstick coating for maximum durability , 1 Float & Lock Hinge for top,melting & more , Signature Foreman heating elements for even heat & faster temperature recovery , Locking side latches allow for vertical storage , Safe,touch top housing for an attractive look & added security , Extended metal loop handle provides peace of mind during use , Preheat indicator light for added convenience , Dishwasher safe drip tray offers easy cleanup Amazon.com If you're lactose-intolerant or concerned about other health issues, studies show that whole soy milk is an excellent part of a cancer-preventive diet. The soybean is a legume, very high in protein, vitamins, and iron, and contains five known classes of anticancer agents. Soy milk is rich, naturally sweet, and lactose- and cholesterol-free. This electronic fresh soy milk maker takes just 18 minutes to grind and brew soybeans into 5 cups of fresh, fat-free, pasteurized soy milk, at a much cheaper cost than buying it in the store. The stainless-steel pitcher is dishwasher-safe, while the mesh filter and stainless-steel grinding blades should be hand washed. The leftover ground soybeans can be used in various dishes such as soups or dressings; 11 recipes for beans and milk (add spices, honey, berries, etc.) are included. For best results, use organic soybeans, either canned or dehydrated. --Doree Armstrong","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TJUOZVbUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nutritionist","source_asin":"B00004R945","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004R945","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004R945","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
