window.products.push({"id":949851,"name":"Oarencol Cute Easter Bunny Strawberries Rabbit Spring Summer Placemat Table Mats Set of 6, Heat-Resistant Washable Clean Kitchen Place Mats for Dining","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CIoFJ+s1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ABOUT OARENCOL PLACEMATS : Oarencol beautiful stylish table place mats to add more fun to your dining table, kitchen table, coffee time,meal time, offer you a comfortable, relaxing, farmhouse, natural enviroment. And great for BBQ ,under your coffee maker, patio, Halloween, Thanksgiving and Christmas dinner, outside parties and casual kitchen decor. Oarencol Placemats provide great dining experience for you ! MATERIAL : Polyester SIZE : 18\"X12\" (45cmX30cm) PACKAGE : Placemats set of 1/ 4/ 6 FEATURES : Double-sided printing, can be used on both sides. Double Layer. The double-needle crimping line around is strong and beautiful. No fading, non slip, heat resistant. Washable, easy to clean. FUNNY DESIGN : Oarencol colorful and cute Pattern Perfect for daily use and are the perfect addition to your dinner tabl, good match with dark wood table, glass table, white dining table, wooden farmhouse table, brown dinning table. Used as placemats, coasters, potholders and heat pads on dining tables, tea tables and panios. Stylish placemats will be a good decor and quality of life for your home, dorm,restaurant, kitchen, hotel and business office. Including birthday, Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas, housewarming, graduation, etc. CARE INSTRUCTIONS : Cleaned with water and dry under the shade. No machinewash or disinfected with microwaves. When you meet Crease Problem , please soak it into warm water and take it out, and put some heavy thing on it, then the Crease will disappear. SERVICE ASSURANCE : If you have any issues, suggestions, questions, or concerns. Please tell us, we will respond you within 24 hours and resolve the issue as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CIoFJ+s1L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oarencol","source_asin":"B081Q8879L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081Q8879L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081Q8879L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":949852,"name":"Couple on Train Station by The Macneil Studio, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NAFF9l+pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a couple embracing on the platform as the train approaches. Richard macneil, a self taught artist, formed the macneil studio in 2009 with his wife Judy and their sons Daniel and Kyle. Born in Winchester, macneil started his working life as an artist at Worcester royal porcelain and has always worked in the fields of sculpture, ceramics, and illustration, both in the UK and internationally. He spent many years living on the East coast of the USA, then returned to Worcestershire and freelanced as an artist and greeting card designer. Richard spends any spare time he has with his family walking in the beautiful British countryside and fishing. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NAFF9l+pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B06ZYRXXXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZYRXXXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZYRXXXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
