window.products.push({"id":949886,"name":"netoolen Wearable Blanket Poncho Women, 66 x 80 inches Blanket Hoodie Cape with Pockets, Dual- Used Keep Warm Cozy Sherpa Fleece Oversize Sweatshirt T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gsVxRPkGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Warmer Laminated Fabric: Upgraded double layer thickened fabric keeps you jolly cozy in the winter. Velvety flannel top and fuzzy Sherpa bottom is doubly warm. With a chest circumference of 65 inches and 82 inches when folded out, this blanket poncho fits women and men of all sizes, draping down to the calves to cover up the whole body with legs pulled in Newest Two-way Design: It’s an oversize sweatshirt, but also a blanket throw. You can button up the sleeves to make it into a hoodie, and unbutton to use as a throw. Stay warm for when having a hooray or during down moments. One blanket fulfills all your needs, perfect for couples and family All Situation Blanket: This blanket poncho treats you with the softest nestle when you are watching TV, reading, working, gaming, resting, or napping. Two large pockets keep your hands warm, while storing your phone, remote, and snacks. You can also wear it to camping, picnic, RV trips, and music festivals to stay chill and warm and have a blast Thoughtful Holiday Presents: Give these warm wrap blanket capes to your family, friends, boy/girlfriend, neighbors, children on holidays to offer them the sweetest companionship and nestle. Your pets will also find them irresistible. These blanket hoodies are also ideal gift for Thanksgiving / Christmas / Valentine / Birthdays / Holidays User Tips: Our double-faced blanket sweatshirts are made of premium flannel and Sherpa that won’t pill, fade, deform, or tear. Machine washable with water under 86℉, tumble dry, do not bleach, or iron. They will be good as new out of the washer. If you have any issues with our products, please email us and we will respond within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gsVxRPkGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"netoolen","source_asin":"B09BFLHD7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BFLHD7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BFLHD7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
