window.products.push({"id":949935,"name":"YALESS Corded Vacuum Cleaner, Real 20Kpa Powerful Suction Stick Vacuum, 5-in-1 Handheld Vacuum with Less Heat and Less Noise 60db Multi-Purpose & Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bI5HLmRNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Real 20Kpa Super Powerful Suction yet Ultra-Quiet--due to no friction of any carbon brush, stick vacuum cleaner upgraded high-power 200W brushless motor generates much less heat and less noise (60db), which results in more energy-saving and longer service life (10 years), compared with other regular brushed motors. The corded vacuum 120,000 rpm fan speed delivers super-strong fade-free suction power Quick & Thorough Clean--Yaless corded vacuum cleaner is the most powerful, and most cost-effective model among stick corded vacuum cleaners. Corded stick vacuum offers continuous 20KPa suction in MAX mode, which instantly picks up pet hair, fine dust, debris, large particles from carpet, hardwood floor, tile floor, marble floor, etc. Multi-purpose & Lightweight--Corded vacuum with brush tool, or crevice tool can be attached to a retractable tube to clean the du-st on the ceiling or curtains, and the stick cordless vacuum can be switched into a handheld vacuum to pick up debris on the table or in the gap between the car's seats; you can also attach the cleaner head to the main motor to clean the stairs with ease. Stick vacuum one button quickly to empty the 1.5L extra-large du-st cup without touching the dirt. Upgraded High-efficiency HEPA Filter--Vaccumm-cordless with a 5-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system captures 99.99% of dus-t particles as small as 0.1micro, such as pollen, pet dander, hair, etc. With both a high-efficiency HEPA filter and a high-density mesh filter combined, the whole filtration performance is 2x that of the normal filter. This can extend the life of the machine, expel purified air, and avoid secondary pollution by preventing the motor from being blocked by microdust. Compact Storage | No-worry Service--The corded stick vacuum cleaner has easy ways to store it: wall-hanging. Please Note: The HEPA filter can't be washed, you can clean it by cleaning gadget. The corded vacuum cleaner that you order from our store comes with a 24-month 100% satisfaction after-sales service and 24x7 online customer service. We're always happy to help if there are any concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bI5HLmRNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YALESS","source_asin":"B09ZTHJQT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTHJQT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTHJQT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":949936,"name":"Khloe Flat Weave Flower and Diamond Pring Rug in Red/Multi 2.6' X 9'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G62sBlzJL._AC_.jpg","description":"AE4860 400-1121(2.6' x 9') Size: 2.6' x 9' Cotton warp and wool weft for added textureClassic Home and Global Home introduce to you the wool kilims of the Sara collection. Made with Turkish wool, the designs in the Sara collection combine southwestern patterns, transitional flair and a wide color palette. The use of turkish wool in a cotton warp and wool weft provides for a soft, high quality texture. Made in India, any flat woven selection in the Sara collection will surely enhance your timeless decor. Features: -Flat woven kilims made with Turkish wool -Cotton warp and wool weft for added texture -Designs combining southwestern and transitional flair with bold colors -Available in the following sizes: 3'6'' x 5'6'', 5' x 8', 8' x 10, Runner 2'6'' x 9' Note: Please be aware that actual colors may vary from those shown on your screen. Accent rugs may also not show the entire pattern that the corresponding area rugs have. Additionally, rugs 8' x 10' and larger may ship Truck Freight. About Classic Home Classic Home has created a treasure trove of area rugs. Featuring designs that range from traditional to contemporary, elegant to whimsical. By utilizing natural fiber constructions, to luxurious New Zealand wool, Classic Home's rugs allow the designer to bring affordable style to any home. Classic Concepts, Inc., established in 1987, is a leading importer of area rugs and textiles. Their distribution headquarters is a 70,000 sq. ft. warehouse in Bell, California, only minutes from downtown Los Angeles. We have showroom in New York, Exton, PA, San Francisco, Seattle, Chicago, Atlanta, High Point, Denver, Dallas and Los Angeles. Their mission is to establish ourselves as the premier casual lifestyle floor covering resource in the market, by creating leading edge designs, delivering quality tested products, and by providing customer service satisfaction to our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G62sBlzJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Home Rugs","source_asin":"B002EYUXMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-949936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002EYUXMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002EYUXMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
